# never commit compiled payloads
*.dll
*.bin
# block vendor/native-host binaries by default...
*.exe
*.msi
*.pdf
# ...but DO ship the archived vulnerable extensions and the one native-host
# installer we have, for reproducibility:
!targets/**/extension/**
!targets/**/*.crx
!targets/06-certiplugin/native-host/Setup_CertiPlugin.exe
